# ? Env files (build-time envs are passed as a BuildKit secret, never through the context)
**/.env*
**/*.local

# ? Docker related files
**/.dockerignore
**/dockerfile
**/dockerfile.dockerignore
**/docker-compose*.yml

# ? Artefacts (regenerated inside the build)
**/node_modules
**/build
**/dist
**/out
**/.turbo
**/.tanstack
**/.unlighthouse
**/*generated*
templates/web/mpa/src/gen
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# ? VCS, CI and IDE
**/.git
**/.github
**/.devcontainer
**/.vscode
**/.zed
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store

# ? docs
**/README.md
**/*.mdx
**/*.stories.*

# ? logs and reports
**/logs
**/*.log

# ? Models
**/*.onnx
